@AndreyTretyak I am looking if we can fix the behavior of `GetBaggageItem` in 5.0 to return the last added entry instead of the first. I'll let you know how this will go. I have 2 questions for you now:
- If we fixed `GetBaggageItem`, would that be enough for you to fix your scenarios? 
- regarding `Servise1(net core 3.1) -> Service2 (net5.0) -> Service3(net472)`, do you have control over such services to upgrade to the latest `System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource` package version? I am asking because the version we ship with 5.0, can be used in net core 3.1 and net472 too. if you can upgrade the package version, you'll always have very consistent behavior at that time.
